        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Wall hanging of embroidered canvas with silks. With a large all-over pattern of conventional flowers and leaves in pinks, greens, blues and fawn on a mid-brown background. With silks in long and short, brick, satin and darning stitches on a canvas ground. Edged with woven braid and lined with green silk."@en ;
