        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This hanging was embroidered by the Beale family when living in Holland Park, London, before their move to Standen in 1894. It is likely that the Beale family was introduced to the work of Morris & Co. by their near neighbours in Holland Park, the Ionides family."@en ;
